By \cref{TTW,PolyApexMinorTheorem}:

\begin{cor}
For any apex graph  $A$ with $t$ vertices, and for  every $A$-minor-free graph $G$,
$$\ttw(G)\in O^\ast(t^{18}).$$
\end{cor}

By \cref{TTW,K3tMinorFreeIntro}:

\begin{cor}
For every $K_{3,t}$-minor-free graph $G$,
$$\ttw(G) \in O^\ast( t^9 ).$$
\end{cor}

