\section{Experiments}\label{sec:exp}
\subsection{Experimental Settings}
\textbf{Datasets and Models.} We evaluate BadViM on CIFAR-10 and ImageNet-1K (100-class subset) using ViM-Tiny \cite{ViM_ZhuL0W0W24}, VMamba-Tiny \cite{VMamba_LiuTZYX0YJ024} and MambaOut-Tiny \cite{mambaout_yu2025mambaout} for reference.
MambaOut removes the SSM module and therefore works more like a Gated CNN model.
