\item $\mathcal{M}$ and $\mathcal{N}$ have only two inner points of tangency points iff $I_3 =0$, $I_4 =0$ and $I_5<0$.%\textcolor{red}{MEJORA}

 \item  $\mathcal{M}$ and $\mathcal{N}$ have only an intersection point and an inner tangent point iff $\Delta=0$, $\Delta'=0$, $I_3<0$ and $I_5<0$.%\textcolor{red}{NEW} % \textcolor{red}{esto implica $I_4<0$}

