%. Let ${\cal X}=(X ,\, Y  ,\, 1 )$. The implicit equation of $\mathcal{M}$ in $\R^2$ can be written as
or in matricial form $\mathcal{M}: {\cal X}{\bf M}{\cal X}^{t}=0$, with
