Now, since $M_2$ is symmetric, it is real diagonalizable and then, there exist an orthogonal matrix $P$ and a diagonal matrix $D$ such that $P^tM_2P=D=\rm diag(b_0,b_2)$, $D$ defined by the eigenvalues of $M_2$,
$$
b_0=\dfrac{{\rm Trace }\, M_2 +\sqrt{(a_{11}-a_{22})^2 +4a_{12}^2}}{2},\quad
