\begin{theorem}\label{thm:tamariLow}
	Let $(P,Q)$ be a Tamari interval of size $n$, chosen uniformly at random in $\mathcal{I}_n$. 	Let $I\in[0..2n]$ be an integer chosen uniformly at random, and let $P_n(I)$ 
