\section{Simulation Results and Analysis}
\label{sec:simulation_results_and_analysis}

\par In this section, we conduct key simulations to evaluate the performance of the proposed LTQC-DAM method for solving the formulated optimization problem.

\subsection{Simulation Setups}

%
% Scenario and Algorithm Setups
