\section{Numerical experiments}
\label{sec:numerics}


In this section, we present several numerical experiments to evaluate the performance of the proposed algorithm~\eqref{eq:psojump}. First, we assess its effectiveness on benchmark functions, focusing on identifying suitable parameter ranges for the diffusion parameter $\sigma$ as well as comparison on two aforementioned noise types, Gaussian and Cauchy. Next, we compare our algorithm with the original CBO method by analysing performance as the diffusion scaling parameter $\e$ approaches zero.


