M = M_{S,d} := \mathbb{E}_{\alpha \in S} [\mathbf{v}_d (\alpha) \mathbf{v}_d^{\sf{T}}(\alpha)] = \frac{1}{|S|}\sum_{\alpha\in S}\mathbf{v}_d (\alpha) \mathbf{v}_d^{\sf{T}}(\alpha),
