	There is no update if the edit function inserts $d$ before $b$ via $f_e(b)=db$ since $db$ is not defined (i.e., we cannot find sequence $db$ from the initial state in $\mathbf{O}_D$); or if it receives an observation that cannot be observed, i.e., event~$a$.
