\paragraph{How MUDI Complements Existing Resources}
% The MUDI dataset is designed to serve as an accessible, well-documented, and comprehensive resource for advancing DDI research through improved reproducibility and consistent model evaluation.
MUDI serves as a standardized and reproducible resource for multimodal DDI prediction, addressing key limitations of prior datasets (see Table~\ref{tab:data_comparison}).  
