We release the MUDI dataset under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International License (CC BY-NC 4.0)\footnote{\url{https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/}}.
This license enables researchers to copy, distribute, and adapt the dataset for academic purposes, provided that:
\begin{itemize}[leftmargin=2em]
