The data were collected on a xubuntu 22.04 machine with 6.5.0-44-generic kernel, 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-13900HX CPU, and 2 RAM banks of SODIMM Synchronous 4800 MHz.  The executable for each benchmark is built by the regular \texttt{cmake} build mechanism and placed in the build directory.

